    <section class="article-list">

        
        

		

        

        <ul role="list" class="">
             <li role="listitem">
	The Insights landing page offers a snapshot of overall performance for your selected campaign groups.   
</li>
        
             <li role="listitem">
	The Insights report builder page provides predefined reports that help you quickly get started. Each report is pre-populated with common metrics and dimensions that you can edit and customize.   
</li>
        
             <li role="listitem">
	Visualization options let you explore and analyze different data segments across your entire account. You can edit metrics, dimensions, and filters to see data at the granularity that works best for your goals.   
</li>
        </ul>           

		

    </section>

 

    
    
