                    <p class="article-copy-block--description ">The Insights landing page is designed to give you a high-level view of performance data from your selected campaign group over the last seven days. You have the ability to add or remove data from other campaign groups, as well as change the date range to better understand trends over time. The Insights landing page also stores all of your saved reports that have been shared publicly with you. This includes all of the reports that were migrated from Custom Report Builder. Sorting your reports by Last Opened will help you find the reports that you use the most.<br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" /><br class="br-l br-m br-s no-space" />
When you’re ready to dive into data exploration and visualizations, click the Create Report button above the report table.</p>
        






   

    
        
        
  
        
        








 	
    

	


	


        

         

        



		

        

        

     
     

    

    

    







   

    
        
        
  
        
        






    
    
    
    
    
    
    
        
        
    
        
      
    






   

    

































